From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: John Vishnefske <jvishnefske@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 17:52:06 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] std: a DNS stub resolver and /etc/passwd home_dir on
 linux-none

getaddrinfo falls back to DNS after numeric addresses, /etc/hosts and
localhost: linux_none_rt::dns with /etc/resolv.conf, and query ids from
sys::random. It honours hints.ai_family, and EAI_SYSTEM carries errno.

env::home_dir without $HOME reads the user's entry in /etc/passwd, as
getpwuid_r does with only the files database.

Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LLGNtp1UxYCVKzoSmxmpts
